{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167750/extras/34bfd022f54be54b4c6ea024310de46c.avif?t=1726834674\" width=600 height=164 /></span><strong>The Demon Within Me</strong> is a first-person story-driven linear game with frightening gameplay and a disturbing and compelling plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORYLINE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lonely man whose life depends on a list of everyday activities tries to forget a past incident that forever ruined his life\u2014until this desire to forget becomes a living nightmare. Will you be able to forget the past?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your daily routine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience horrifying events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through your memories, connecting all the parts of your mind together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to forget. Try to not lose your mind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The duration of the game is around one and a half hours long.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2167750?t=1726834674","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2167750?t=1726834674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1726834674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1726834674","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This video game contains disturbing imagery, drug references and moment